version: 1.2
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22978034
date-released: 2026-09-26
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/BlueMarbleSpace/avalon"
abstract: >-
  AVALON is a one-dimensional Budyko-Sellers energy balance climate model
  (latitude-dependent, seasonally forced, with ice-albedo feedback and CO2
  forcing) written in Julia for the FILLET energy balance model
  intercomparison project.
